    "Scan of the 1970 edition of the Stevens Point, Wisconsin, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1976; field checked in 1970; photo inspected in 1980; photo revised in 1978; last revised in 1978; printed in 1990.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22.6 x 27.35 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
